NOTE ON DATA LICENCES

This LICENSE covers the `msat` source code only. The benchmarks it reads —
LongMemEval (S / M / oracle) and LoCoMo — are separately licensed and are NOT
redistributed with this repository. `data.lock` records the SHA-256, byte size,
and row count of every raw input so the committed provenance artifacts stay
verifiable without shipping gigabytes. See DATA_AVAILABILITY.md (Phase 10) for
the full statement, and note the ethics obligation if LoCoMo is ever touched.
